  "title": "Linde Declares Dividend in Fourth Quarter 2025",
  "summary": "Woking, UK, October 27, 2025 – Linde plc (Nasdaq: LIN) announced its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly dividend of $1.50 per share.<br /> <br /> The dividend is payable on December 17, 2025 to shareholders of record on December 3, 2025.",
